      "seed": 2012657800,
      "version": 312,
      "versionNonce": 1328050056,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1740997263587,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1️⃣ User inputs query\n\n2️⃣ ReAct Agent decides whether to:\n\n(i) Expand\n(ii) Decompose\n(iii) Modify query\n\n3️⃣ Tree-of-Thought Agent:\n(a) Generates multiple refined queries\n(b) Ranks them based on retrieval quality\n(c) Picks the best query for final retrieval",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "PudBLzCy_i1Ke4DnksgsZ",
      "originalText": "1️⃣ User inputs query\n\n2️⃣ ReAct Agent decides whether to:\n\n(i) Expand\n(ii) Decompose\n(iii) Modify query\n\n3️⃣ Tree-of-Thought Agent:\n(a) Generates multiple refined queries\n(b) Ranks them based on retrieval quality\n(c) Picks the best query for final retrieval",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
