      "updated": 1742040999815,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Break up the factors into specific schemas:\n(i) Question structure: str\n=> Reasoning (Specificity, Completeness)\n=> Propose how to improve\n(ii) Abbreviation: List[str]\n=> List of abbreviations to expand\n=> Propose expansions\n(iii) Domain: List[str]\n=> List of domain-specific terminologies\n=> Propose to extract as keywords as well\n(iv) Keywords: List[str]\n=> List of keywords\n=> Propose ???\n(v) Open vs Closed\n=> Reasoning on differences",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Break up the factors into specific schemas:\n(i) Question structure: str\n=> Reasoning (Specificity, Completeness)\n=> Propose how to improve\n(ii) Abbreviation: List[str]\n=> List of abbreviations to expand\n=> Propose expansions\n(iii) Domain: List[str]\n=> List of domain-specific terminologies\n=> Propose to extract as keywords as well\n(iv) Keywords: List[str]\n=> List of keywords\n=> Propose ???\n(v) Open vs Closed\n=> Reasoning on differences",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
